1
00:00:00,078 --> 00:00:03,788
(Leonard:)Almost there.

2
00:00:03,956 --> 00:00:05,626
(Leonard:)- Almost there.
SHELDON: No, we're not.

3
00:00:05,792 --> 00:00:08,002
(Sheldon:)- No, we're not. No, we're not.
- I'm sorry.

4
00:00:09,212 --> 00:00:10,592
(Sheldon:)- Watch your fingers.
- Yeah.

5
00:00:10,755 --> 00:00:13,215
(Sheldon:)Oh, God, my fingers!

6
00:00:14,884 --> 00:00:16,964
- You okay?
- No, it hurt...

7
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:20,346
(Sheldon:)Great Caesar's ghost, look at this place.

8
00:00:21,974 --> 00:00:23,394
So Penny is a little messy.

9
00:00:23,559 --> 00:00:25,229
(Sheldon:)A little messy?

10
00:00:25,395 --> 00:00:28,315
(Sheldon:)The Mandelbrot set
of complex numbers is a little messy.

11
00:00:28,481 --> 00:00:29,611
(Sheldon:)This is chaos.

12
00:00:29,774 --> 00:00:31,734
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

13
00:00:31,901 --> 00:00:33,191
Explain to me a system...

14
00:00:33,361 --> 00:00:36,531
(Sheldon:)...where a tray of flatware
on a couch is valid?

15
00:00:36,697 --> 00:00:38,657
(Sheldon:)I'm just inferring that this is a couch...

16
00:00:38,825 --> 00:00:42,785
(Sheldon:)...because the evidence suggests
the coffee table's having a tiny garage sale.

17
00:00:43,663 --> 00:00:47,003
Did it occur to you that not everyone
has the compulsive need to sort...

18
00:00:47,166 --> 00:00:49,626
...organize and label
the entire world around them?

19
00:00:50,503 --> 00:00:52,133
(Leonard:)No.

20
00:00:53,089 --> 00:00:54,299
(Leonard:)Well, they don't.

21
00:00:54,465 --> 00:00:56,025
Hard as it may be to believe...

